<title>USA: Grossman's Q4 oper sales rises 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Grossman's Q4 oper sales rises 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grossman's Inc said Tuesday it posted fourth quarter operating sales of $89.1 million, a 9.2 percent increase from the $81.6 million in operating sales it reported in the prior year's fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Sales for the year ended December 31 from ongoing operations were $337.8 million, a 10.5 percent increase from the prior year's operating sales of $306.6 million.</p>
</text>
